      <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-4xl">
        Paired comparison on the <strong>860 molecules</strong> where
        B3LYP/6-31G* converges (124 mol containing heavy elements — Ag,
        Au, transition metals, I — are excluded on the B3LYP side, plus
        9 SCF failures and 8 pathological |err| &gt; 5 eV outliers like
        S₂F₁₀ at −114 eV). Identical geometries (RDKit MMFF + diatomic
        tables), Scott-Radom ZPE × 0.9806.
      </p>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-6">
        <div class="rounded-lg border-2 border-thmblue/30 bg-thmblue/5 p-5">
