          of the 860 pairs (610 PTC wins vs 250 B3LYP wins). MAE gain:
          {((1 - b2.ptc.mae_eV / b2.b3lyp.mae_eV) * 100).toFixed(0)} %.
          Chemical accuracy: {(b2.ptc.chem_acc_pct / b2.b3lyp.chem_acc_pct).toFixed(1)}× better.
        </p>
